    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1.设向量 $\\vec{a},\\vec{b}$ 满足 $|\\vec{a} -\\vec{b}| = |\\vec{a} +\\vec{b} |$ ，则必有（）.A. $\\vec{a} -\\vec{b} = \\vec{0}$ B. $\\vec{a} +\\vec{b} = \\vec{0}$ C. $\\vec{a}\\cdot \\vec{b} = 0$ D. $\\vec{a}\\times \\vec{b} = \\vec{0}$",
        "bbox": [
            78,
            307,
            744,
            367
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2.二元函数 $f(x,y)=2x-4y-x^{2}-2y^{2}$ 的驻点是（）.\nA. $(-1,-1)$ B. $(1,-1)$ C. $(-1,1)$ D.(1,1)",
        "bbox": [
            78,
            385,
            705,
            428
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.函数 $z = 3^{xy}$ ，则在点(1,1)处的全微分 $dz = (\\quad)$ A. $dx$ B. $dy$ C. $3(dx + dy)\\ln 3$ D. $dx + dy$",
        "bbox": [
            78,
            441,
            727,
            485
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4.设C是按逆时针方向绕行的圆周曲线 $x^{2}+y^{2}=R^{2}$ ，则 $\\oint_{C}xy^{2}dy-x^{2}ydx=(\\quad)$ .\nA. $\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{R}r^{3}dr$ B. $\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{R}r^{2}dr$ C. $-\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{R}4r^{3}\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta dr$ D. $\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{R}R^{2}dr$",
        "bbox": [
            78,
            498,
            717,
            607
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "5.下列正项级数中，收敛的是（）.\nA. $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{5^{n}-3^{n}}{4^{n}}$ B. $\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{n}{2^{n}}$ C. $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}$ D. $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{n+1}{n^{2}}$",
        "bbox": [
